    "complete_payload_interpretation": "Python3 CLI. It discovers the project DAG under '.', obtains levels_backward, reverses the levels unless --reverse, and flattens their order. Non-interactive stdin accepts either module names or .lean filenames, converting paths to dotted names; only a nonempty input set activates filtering. Empty/blank stdin leaves all modules in the output, and names outside the discovered graph are silently omitted. There is no formal topological-sort correctness theorem in this source."
